{
  "title": "Ziyarate Janabe Zainab (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ یَا بِنْتَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta rasuli allahi\nPeace be upon you, O daughter of the Messenger of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ یَا بِنْتَ نَبِیِّ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta nabiyyi allahi\npeace be upon you, O daughter of the Prophet of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ یَا بِنْتَ مُحَمَّدٍ الْمُصْطَفیٰ\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta muhammadin almustafa\npeace be upon you, O daughter of Muhammad al-Mustafa,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ یَا بِنْتَ وَلِیِّ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta waliyyi allahi\npeace be upon you, O daughter of the intimate friend of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ یَا بِنْتَ عَلِیٍّ الْمُرْتَضیٰ سَیِّدِ الْاَوْصِیَائِ وَالصِّدِّیِقِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta `aliyyin almurtada sayyidi al-awsiya'i walssiddiqina\npeace be upon you, O daughter of `Ali al-Murtada, master of the successors and the truthful,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا بِنْتَ فَاطِمََۃَ الزَّهْرَائِ سَیِّدَۃِ نِسَائِ الْعٰلَمِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta fatimata alzzahra'i sayyidati nisa'i al`alamina\npeace be upon you, O daughter of Fatimah al-Zahra', mistress of the women of the worlds,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اُخْتَ الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَیْنِ سَیِّدَیْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّۃِ اَجْمَعِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayki ya ukhta alhasani walhusayni sayyiday shababi ahli aljannati ajma`ina\npeace be upon you, O sister of al-Hasan and al-Husain, the two masters of the youth of Paradise, all of them,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا السَّیِّدَۃُ الزَّكِیَّۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alssayyidatu alzzakiyyatu\npeace be upon you, O the pure lady,\nاَالسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیَّتُهَا الدَّاعِیَۃُ الْخَفِیِّۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha aldda`iyatu alkhafiyyatu\npeace be upon you, O the hidden caller (to the truth),\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا التَّقِیَّۃُ النَّقِیَّۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alttaqiyyatu alnnaqiyyatu\npeace be upon you, O the pious, the pure,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا الرَّاضِیَۃُ الْمَرْضِیَّۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alrradiyatu almardiyyatu\npeace be upon you, O the content one, well-pleasing to her Lord,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا الْعَالِمَۃُ الْغَیْرُ الْمُعَلَّمَۃِ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha al`alimatu alghayru almu`allamati\npeace be upon you, O the learned one who was not taught by any human,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا الْفَهِیْمَۃُ الْغَیْرُ الْمُفَهَّمَۃِ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alfahimatu alghayru almufahhamati\npeace be upon you, O the discerning one who was not instructed by any human,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا الْمَظْلُوْمَۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha almazlumatu\npeace be upon you, O the wronged one,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا الْمَغْمُوْمَۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha almaghmumatu\npeace be upon you, O the grief-stricken one,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا الصِّدِّیْقَۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alssiddiqatu\npeace be upon you, O the truthful one,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتُهَا الْمَكْرُوْبَۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha almakrubatu\npeace be upon you, O the sorrow-laden one,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیَّتُهَا الْمَاسُوْرَۃُ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha almasuratu\npeace be upon you, O the captive one,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكِ اَیَّتَهَا الصَّاحِبَۃُ الْمُصِیْبَۃِ الْعُظْمیٰ\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alssahibatu almusibati al`uzma\npeace be upon you, O bearer of the greatest calamity,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا زَیْنَبُ الْكُبْریٰ\nalssalamu `alayki ya zaynabu alkubra\npeace be upon you, O Zainab the Great,\nوَرَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nwa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand Allah’s mercy and blessings."
}
